  "source_observations": [
    "Action Deserialize calls Action::new(CustomActionData); a set_tweak object is parsed as Tweak.",
    "Tweak::new for sound decodes its raw value as SoundTweakValue, a StringEnum with a custom owned-string variant.",
    "Action/Tweak serialization retains the set_tweak and sound value, so the oversized value is actual serialized SDK metadata, not an ignored field.",
    "TimelineEvent exposes set_push_actions and push_actions separately from its raw event; bundled_latest_thread_event instead derives its event from raw unsigned relations."
  ],
